+    /// Returns the original blocking-check or reactor-registration error unchanged.
+    /// Returns [`io::ErrorKind::InvalidInput`] if registration was already attempted.
+    /// Every outcome, including unwind, forbids another attempt. A failed source
+    /// may already contain registration state; retention does not imply rollback.
+    ///
